# Read combo — recent diffs plus current-source impact
#
# Regression target: history/diff observations and current-source evidence are
# both first-class. The answer must keep each recent commit/diff lane visible,
# then relate the historical change to the current implementation. It must not
# collapse to a scalar commit id or force old diff hunks into current-source
# citations.
ID="read_combo_git_two_diffs_current_code"
NAME="read combo — recent two diffs plus current code impact"
QUESTION="对比最近两次提交的代码 diff，再结合当前源码分析它们分别影响了哪些当前实现链路；请说明每次提交的 diff 线索、当前关键代码、作用和影响，不要只给 commit id。"
EXPECT_NOT_CONTAINS="**值：**"
EXPECT_MATCHES_REGEX="(最近|两次|2).*提交|提交.*(最近|两次|2)
(commit|提交|[Dd]iff|差异).*(当前|源码|现在|实现)|(当前|源码|现在|实现).*(commit|提交|[Dd]iff|差异)
(作用|影响|链路|关系|当前关键代码|实现链路).*(commit|提交|[Dd]iff|当前|源码)|(commit|提交|[Dd]iff|当前|源码).*(作用|影响|链路|关系|当前关键代码|实现链路)"
